  "description": "Installation of 13 external signs: 1a. Woven Mesh Fascia Panel with new Illuminated Renault Emblem and Dealer Name\r\n1b. Woven Mesh Fascia Panel\r\n2. Overhead Entrance Marker\r\n3. Dacia Fascia border with Illuminated Built Up Letters\r\n4. Illuminated Alpine fascia\r\n5. Non-illuminated RENEW sign above door.\r\n6. 3x12m Flagpoles with Flags.\r\n7. 6.5m Renault Totem Retrofit with backlit graphics\r\n8. 6.5m Dacia Totem Retrofit with new panels\r\n9. 5mx5m Headline Display Area with poster unit\r\n10. 11. 7mx5m Renault Test Drive Display Area with free standing mast\r\n11. Woven Mesh Fascia Panel with new Illuminated Renault Emblem & Letters\r\n12. Renault Service Panel\r\n13. Dacia Service Panel\r\n",
